# Secrets. .env.local holds your service account private key.
#
# Ignore every .env* and add the template back by name, rather than listing
# the variants: the previous list named .env.local, .env*.local and
# .env.smoke, and .env.local.backup - which is a copy of the file holding
# the key - matched none of them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.local.example
*-service-account*.json
serviceAccount*.json

